data: {"id": "46af527662e44ab5-thinking-parallel_evidence-1149", "run_id": "46af527662e44ab5", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "## 已采集事实\n\n1. **生命周期确认**（Metrics + describe）：\n   - Pod `aiops-case-v05/workload` (UID: `b9e687f5-702b-4d01-bfb9-2df4ff23ba91`) 当前状态为 **Pending**，phase=PENDING。\n   - 容器 `app` 处于 **Waiting** 状态，等待原因为 `ContainerCreating`。\n   - `kube_pod_container_status_restarts_total=0`，无重启。\n\n2. **节点调度**（Topology）：\n   - Pod 已调度到 **node2** (10.2.0.50)，容器 `app` 由该 Pod 拥有。\n\n3. **根因证据**（kubectl describe 事件）：\n   - **核心报错**：`MountVolume.SetUp failed for volume \"input\" : configmap references non-existent config key: unava", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 2, "ts_ms": 1789123082763, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

