data: {"id": "46af527662e44ab5-node_complete-parallel_evidence", "run_id": "46af527662e44ab5", "seq": 1150, "ts_ms": 1789123089351, "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "并发证据采集", "duration_seconds": 21.309, "state_snapshot": {"contract_version": "aiops.parallel-evidence-output.v2", "group_count": 1, "expected_group_count": 1, "terminal_group_count": 1, "join_complete": true, "diagnosed_count": 1, "inconclusive_count": 0, "error_count": 0, "errors": [], "groups": [{"group_id": "g1", "presentation_index": 0, "entities": [{"kind": "Pod", "namespace": "aiops-case-v05", "name": "workload"}], "diagnostic_status": "diagnosed", "artifact_ref": {"path": "/tmp/aiops/reports/context_archives/46af527662e44ab5-g1/lane_artifacts/g1/artifact.json", "sha256": "db1286a73e970c392da34e14eaf5f14adb5b444c83259d7e22d35d1a22fba913", "bytes": 2569}, "snapshot_sha256": "05b8c89424cbc724f0fa180490066c8c1e49af4ca62a1f877613d87ecb1af663"}]}, "handoff_summary": ""}

event: node_start
data: {"id": "46af527662e44ab5-node_start-conclusion", "run_id": "46af527662e44ab5", "seq": 1151, "ts_ms": 1789123089351, "node": "conclusion", "node_name": "汇总总结"}

event: node_complete
data: {"id": "46af527662e44ab5-node_complete-conclusion", "run_id": "46af527662e44ab5", "seq": 1152, "ts_ms": 1789123096571, "node": "conclusion", "node_name": "汇总总结", "duration_seconds": 7.219, "state_snapshot": {"conclusion_length": 1438, "has_errors": false, "has_warnings": false, "conclusion": "## 📊 异常概览与现象\n\n| 组 | 异常实体 | 异常状态 | 关键错误信息 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| g1 | `aiops-case-v05/workload` | ContainerCreating | Pod aiops-case-v05/workload stuck in ContainerCreating state due to FailedMount |\n\n---\n\n## 🕵️ 证据内容 · g1\n\n| # | 类型 | 来源 | 真实原始结果 | 诊断作用 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | K8s Event | kubernetes | `fact-a735e31809e8` Warning FailedMount: MountVolume.SetUp failed for volume \"input\" : configmap references non-existent config key: unavailable-key | 确定挂载失败的根本原因，指向 ConfigMap 中的无效引用 |\n| 2 | K8s Event | kubernetes | `fact-fd0360b1a5e4` Warning FailedMount: unmounted volumes=[input]: timed out waiting for the condition | 确认挂载尝试已发生并超时，印证了 Volume 配置问题 |\n| 3 | K8s State | kubernetes | `fact-14128f3b1f64` Pod status: Pending | 确认 Pod 最终状态为 Pending |\n| 4 | Metric | prometheus | `fact-343d8531d3ab` waiting_reason=ContainerCreating, value=1 | 辅助确认容器当前处于等待挂载资源的状态 |\n\n证据 1 提供了具体的错误原由：`configmap references non-existent config key: unavailable-key`。这一结果被证据 2 的超时报错所验证，说明 kubelet 因无法获取该 Key 而持续尝试挂载并最终失败。证据 3 和 4 分别从 Pod 状态和 Metrics 角度反映了该失败导致的最终现象。\n\n## 🎯 根因分析 · g1\n\n### 因果链\n\n```text\nConfigMap 'workload-input' 中引用了不存在的 key 'unavailable-key' → kubelet 执行 MountVolume.SetUp 失败 → 卷挂载超时 → Pod 卡在 Pending/ContainerCreating 状态\n```\n\n### 根因结论\n\n已确认根因为 **Volume 挂载配置错误**。\nPod `aiops-case-v05/workload` 尝试挂载名为 `input` 的卷时，因引用的 ConfigMap `workload-input` 中缺失指定的 key `unavailable-key`，导致 `MountVolume.SetUp` 失败并超时，最终使容器无法启动，Pod 保持 Pending 状态（证据 1、2）。", "conclusion_formatted": "## 📊 异常概览与现象\n\n| 组 | 异常实体 | 异常状态 | 关键错误信息 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| g1 | `aiops-case-v05/workload` | ContainerCreating | Pod aiops-case-v05/workload stuck in ContainerCreating state due to FailedMount |\n\n---\n\n## 🕵️ 证据内容 · g1\n\n| # | 类型 | 来源 | 真实原始结果 | 诊断作用 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | K8s Event | kubernetes | `fact-a735e31809e8` Warning FailedMount: MountVolume.SetUp failed for volume \"input\" : configmap references non-existent config key: unavailable-key | 确定挂载失败的根本原因，指向 ConfigMap 中的无效引用 |\n| 2 | K8s Event | kubernetes | `fact-fd0360b1a5e4` Warning FailedMount: unmounted volumes=[input]: timed out waiting for the condition | 确认挂载尝试已发生并超时，印证了 Volume 配置问题 |\n| 3 | K8s State | kubernetes | `fact-14128f3b1f64` Pod status: Pending | 确认 Pod 最终状态为 Pending |\n| 4 | Metric | prometheus | `fact-343d8531d3ab` waiting_reason=ContainerCreating, value=1 | 辅助确认容器当前处于等待挂载资源的状态 |\n\n证据 1 提供了具体的错误原由：`configmap references non-existent config key: unavailable-key`。这一结果被证据 2 的超时报错所验证，说明 kubelet 因无法获取该 Key 而持续尝试挂载并最终失败。证据 3 和 4 分别从 Pod 状态和 Metrics 角度反映了该失败导致的最终现象。\n\n## 🎯 根因分析 · g1\n\n### 因果链\n\n```text\nConfigMap 'workload-input' 中引用了不存在的 key 'unavailable-key' → kubelet 执行 MountVolume.SetUp 失败 → 卷挂载超时 → Pod 卡在 Pending/ContainerCreating 状态\n```\n\n### 根因结论\n\n已确认根因为 **Volume 挂载配置错误**。\nPod `aiops-case-v05/workload` 尝试挂载名为 `input` 的卷时，因引用的 ConfigMap `workload-input` 中缺失指定的 key `unavailable-key`，导致 `MountVolume.SetUp` 失败并超时，最终使容器无法启动，Pod 保持 Pending 状态（证据 1、2）。"}, "handoff_summary": ""}

event: final
data: {"id": "46af527662e44ab5-final", "run_id": "46af527662e44ab5", "seq": 1154, "ts_ms": 1789123096580, "status": "success", "answer": "## 📊 异常概览与现象\n\n| 组 | 异常实体 | 异常状态 | 关键错误信息 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| g1 | `aiops-case-v05/workload` | ContainerCreating | Pod aiops-case-v05/workload stuck in ContainerCreating state due to FailedMount |\n\n---\n\n## 🕵️ 证据内容 · g1\n\n| # | 类型 | 来源 | 真实原始结果 | 诊断作用 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | K8s Event | kubernetes | `fact-a735e31809e8` Warning FailedMount: MountVolume.SetUp failed for volume \"input\" : configmap references non-existent config key: unavailable-key | 确定挂载失败的根本原因，指向 ConfigMap 中的无效引用 |\n| 2 | K8s Event | kubernetes | `fact-fd0360b1a5e4` Warning FailedMount: unmounted volumes=[input]: timed out waiting for the condition | 确认挂载尝试已发生并超时，印证了 Volume 配置问题 |\n| 3 | K8s State | kubernetes | `fact-14128f3b1f64` Pod status: Pending | 确认 Pod 最终状态为 Pending |\n| 4 | Metric | prometheus | `fact-343d8531d3ab` waiting_reason=ContainerCreating, value=1 | 辅助确认容器当前处于等待挂载资源的状态 |\n\n证据 1 提供了具体的错误原由：`configmap references non-existent config key: unavailable-key`。这一结果被证据 2 的超时报错所验证，说明 kubelet 因无法获取该 Key 而持续尝试挂载并最终失败。证据 3 和 4 分别从 Pod 状态和 Metrics 角度反映了该失败导致的最终现象。\n\n## 🎯 根因分析 · g1\n\n### 因果链\n\n```text\nConfigMap 'workload-input' 中引用了不存在的 key 'unavailable-key' → kubelet 执行 MountVolume.SetUp 失败 → 卷挂载超时 → Pod 卡在 Pending/ContainerCreating 状态\n```\n\n### 根因结论\n\n已确认根因为 **Volume 挂载配置错误**。\nPod `aiops-case-v05/workload` 尝试挂载名为 `input` 的卷时，因引用的 ConfigMap `workload-input` 中缺失指定的 key `unavailable-key`，导致 `MountVolume.SetUp` 失败并超时，最终使容器无法启动，Pod 保持 Pending 状态（证据 1、2）。\n\n---\n\n## 📊 性能统计\n\n```text\n├─ 总耗时: 53.8s\n├─ 问题定位: 25.3s\n├─ 并发证据采集: 21.3s\n│  └─ g1 aiops-case-v05/workload: 21.3s (Evidence 14.8s, RCA 6.5s)\n└─ 汇总总结: 7.2s\n```\n\n📋 Runbook 参考\n\n- **g1 aiops-case-v05/workload**: pod-imagepull-failed\n", "answer_source": "workflow", "elapsed_seconds": 53.843, "metrics": {"run_id": "46af527662e44ab5", "mttr": {"value": "53.8s", "seconds": 53.84964919090271, "pass": true, "threshold": "< 10.0m"}, "evidence_completeness": {"value": "0%", "collected": 0, "planned": 0, "pass": false, "threshold": "> 90%"}, "root_cause_confidence": {"value": "48%", "pass": false, "threshold": ">= 80%"}, "runbook_coverage": {"matched": true, "runbook_id": "pod-imagepull-failed", "pass": true, "score": 0.9333, "breakdown": [{"description": "Runbook 引用", "weight": 0.5, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.5}, {"description": "核心 Runbook 识别", "weight": 0.3, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.3}, {"description": "Runbook 结论关联", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.6666666666666666, "weighted_score": 0.1333}]}, "confidence_breakdown": [{"name": "evidence_strength", "weight": 0.35, "score": 0.0, "weighted_score": 0.0, "description": "加权证据完整率", "detail": "加权完整率 0%"}, {"name": "causal_chain", "weight": 0.2, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.2, "description": "因果链完整性", "detail": "完整因果链"}, {"name": "tool_coverage", "weight": 0.1, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.03, "description": "关键探针覆盖率", "detail": "工具成功率 30%"}, {"name": "runbook_match", "weight": 0.15, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.15, "description": "Runbook 匹配质量", "detail": "核心: pod-imagepull-failed"}, {"name": "llm_self_score", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.5, "weighted_score": 0.1, "description": "LLM 自评分数", "detail": "来源: layer_confidence, 分数: 50%"}], "confidence_penalties": [], "evidence_breakdown": {"total": 0, "breakdown": {}}, "performance": {"total_duration_ms": 53849.64919090271, "llm_calls": 14, "llm_duration_ms": 50815.131187438965, "tool_calls": 13, "executed_tool_calls": 8, "deduplicated_tool_calls": 4, "successful_tool_calls": 12, "failed_tool_calls": 1, "tool_duration_ms": 6414.1294956207275, "tool_wall_duration_ms": 2727.8480529785156}, "nodes": {"layer": {"name": "问题定位", "duration_ms": 25301.16033554077, "success": true}, "parallel_evidence": {"name": "并发证据采集", "duration_ms": 21308.55655670166, "success": true}, "evidence": {"name": "evidence", "duration_ms": 0.0, "success": true}, "rca": {"name": "rca", "duration_ms": 0.0, "success": true}, "conclusion": {"name": "汇总总结", "duration_ms": 7219.258785247803, "success": true}}, "success": true, "errors": []}}

